# Intentionally empty. The logrotate package ships its own default
# rotation stanza at this path; our own, better-tuned rotation for
# /var/log/btmp lives inline in /etc/logrotate.conf (monthly, size cap,
# maxage retention). logrotate treats the same path defined twice as a
# fatal "duplicate log entry" error, so this file is kept empty and
# synced over the package's copy every deploy to prevent that collision.
